{% liquid
assign inquiry_id = 'FabricInquiry-' | append: section.id
assign intro = product.description | split: '</p>' | first | strip_html
%}<div class="dd-fabric"><div class="dd-fabric__hero"><div class="dd-fabric__wrap"><nav class="dd-fabric__crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a> / <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/co2-laser">CO2 Laser Cutting Machines</a> / LZ-1816L</nav><div class="dd-fabric__split"><div><p class="dd-fabric__eyebrow">PANORAMIC VISION · TEXTILE CUTTING</p><h1>{{ product.title | escape }}</h1><p class="dd-fabric__lead">{{ intro }}</p><p><strong>1800 × 1600 mm · 150W × 2</strong><br>Panoramic vision + conveyor table included<br>Automatic roll fabric feeder optional</p><div class="dd-fabric__actions"><a class="dd-fabric__button" href="#{{ inquiry_id }}">Get a Quote</a><a href="#fabric-samples">View Cutting Samples</a></div></div><figure>{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 1400 | image_tag: widths: '480, 750, 1000, 1400', sizes: '(min-width: 900px) 48vw, 100vw', loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', alt: product.featured_image.alt }}<figcaption>Machine photograph for reference. Computer and accessories shown are subject to the agreed configuration.</figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div class="dd-fabric__wrap"><nav class="dd-fabric__nav" aria-label="Product information"><a href="#fabric-samples">Samples</a><a href="#fabric-configuration">Standard &amp; Optional</a><a href="#fabric-specifications">Specifications</a><a href="#fabric-support">Support</a><a href="#fabric-faq">FAQ</a></nav>
<section id="fabric-samples"><p class="dd-fabric__sample-eyebrow">PRINTED FABRIC &amp; DECORATIVE TEXTILES</p><h2>Fabric Cutting Applications &amp; Samples</h2><p>Examples from our product application materials. Send your actual fabric and artwork to confirm contour recognition and edge finish.</p><div class="dd-fabric__samples-grid"><figure>{{ images['lz-1816l-printed-garment-panels.jpg'] | image_url: width: 700 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: 'Printed garment panels on the fabric laser conveyor table' }}<figcaption>Printed garment panels · contour cutting</figcaption></figure><figure>{{ images['lz-1816l-decorative-fabric-cutouts.jpg'] | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: 'Floral decorative cut-out sample from the fabric laser application sheet' }}<figcaption>Decorative cut-outs · material suitability confirmed by testing</figcaption></figure></div><details><summary>Watch the LZ-1816L fabric cutting demonstration</summary><iframe class="dd-fabric__video" src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/AdQeEWKsP5k" title="LZ-1816L CO2 fabric laser cutting demonstration" loading="lazy" allow="encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe></details></section>
<div class="dd-fabric__content">{{ product.description }}</div><section class="dd-fabric__optional"><figure>{{ images['lz-1816l-optional-auto-feeder.jpg'] | image_url: width: 700 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: 'Optional automatic roll fabric feeder' }}<figcaption>Optional separate feeding unit.</figcaption></figure><div><h2>Conveyor Table ≠ Automatic Roll Feeder</h2><p>The standard conveyor moves fabric through the machine. The optional roll feeder is a separate unit that supplies roll fabric to the table.</p><p>Tell us your roll dimensions and handling needs so the proposal clearly lists what is included.</p><a class="dd-fabric__button" href="#{{ inquiry_id }}">Discuss the Feeding Setup</a></div></section>
<section id="fabric-support"><h2>Delivery, Training &amp; Technical Support</h2><div class="dd-fabric__support"><div><h3>Test before selecting</h3><p>Review your printed fabric, artwork and sample results before confirming equipment.</p></div><div><h3>Installation &amp; training</h3><p>English manuals and videos, remote installation training and direct technical support. On-site support can be arranged.</p></div><div><h3>Spare parts &amp; delivery</h3><p>Equipment-specific spare parts and order-specific packing. Configuration and delivery timing are agreed in the quotation.</p></div></div><p><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}#HomeFactory">Explore Our Factory &amp; Team</a></p></section>
<section id="fabric-faq"><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><details><summary>Is the automatic fabric feeder included?</summary><p>The conveyor feeding table is standard. The separate automatic roll fabric feeder is optional and is included only when specified in your quotation.</p></details><details><summary>Is panoramic vision standard on this model?</summary><p>Yes. This model includes panoramic vision positioning for printed-pattern contour cutting. Test your artwork and fabric to confirm recognition and the cut result.</p></details><details><summary>Does the machine print the fabric?</summary><p>No. It cuts fabric, including suitable pre-printed textiles. Printing takes place on separate equipment before vision-guided contour cutting.</p></details><details><summary>Can you test my printed fabric before I order?</summary><p>Yes. We provide a free sample test. Share the fabric composition, artwork, dimensions and required finish. Test and sample shipping arrangements are agreed separately.</p></details><details><summary>How do I get a quotation and delivery schedule?</summary><p>Send your fabric width, material, artwork, output requirements, destination and optional feeder needs. We confirm the configuration and negotiate delivery timing for your order.</p></details></section><section><h2>Related CO2 Laser Equipment</h2><p>For acrylic, wood and suitable sheet-material work, explore the <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}products/lz-1390-industrial-co2-laser-cutting-machine">LZ-1390 CO2 laser cutter</a>. For the full range, browse <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/co2-laser">CO2 Laser Cutting Machines</a>.</p></section>    <section id="{{ inquiry_id }}" class="dd-fabric__inquiry"><h2>Get a Quote for Your Fabric Cutting Application</h2><p>Tell us your fabric composition, width, artwork, output target and whether you need an automatic roll feeder.</p>{% form 'contact', id: inquiry_id %}{% if form.posted_successfully? %}<p class="dd-fabric__success" role="status" tabindex="-1" data-fabric-success>Thank you. Your inquiry has been sent. Our team will review your fabric cutting requirements.</p><dialog class="dd-fabric__dialog" data-fabric-dialog aria-labelledby="FabricThanks-{{ section.id }}"><h2 id="FabricThanks-{{ section.id }}">Thank you for your inquiry</h2><p>Your message has been sent successfully. Our team will review your requirements and contact you.</p><button type="button" class="dd-fabric__button" data-fabric-close>Got it</button></dialog>{% endif %}{{ form.errors | default_errors }}<input type="hidden" name="contact[Product URL]" value="{{ canonical_url | escape }}"><div class="dd-fabric__fields"><label for="Name-{{ section.id }}">Name *<input id="Name-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name" value="{{ form.name | escape }}" required></label><label for="Email-{{ section.id }}">Email *<input id="Email-{{ section.id }}" type="email" name="contact[email]" autocomplete="email" value="{{ form.email | escape }}" required></label><label for="Company-{{ section.id }}">Company<input id="Company-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Company]" autocomplete="organization"></label><label for="Whatsapp-{{ section.id }}">WhatsApp<input id="Whatsapp-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[WhatsApp]" type="tel" autocomplete="tel"></label><label for="Product-{{ section.id }}">Product Interested<input id="Product-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Product Interested]" value="{{ product.title | escape }}"></label><label class="dd-fabric__message" for="Message-{{ section.id }}">Message *<textarea id="Message-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[body]" rows="5" required>{{ form.body | escape }}</textarea></label></div><button class="dd-fabric__button" type="submit">Send Inquiry</button>{% endform %}<p><a href="mailto:info@gzcnc-laser.com">info@gzcnc-laser.com</a> · <a href="https://wa.me/8618988946615">WhatsApp: +86 189 8894 6615</a></p></section></div></div>
